===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schale}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scala}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skalō}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|schaal||shell}}. Also related with {{cog|nl|schil}}, {{cog|en|shell}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f||Schalen}}

# [[peel]]; [[husk]]
# [[shell]]; [[scallop]]
# {{lb|de|hunting}} [[hoof]]

