* {{l|de|Schalentier}}
* {{l|de|Schalenwild}}
* {{l|de|verschalen}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|de|Schellfisch}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schāle}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scāla}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skēlō}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|schaal||bowl}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f||Schalen|Schälchen}}

